WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680
- What are your most
fond memories of Idol?

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:03.240
Because people always ask
me about "American Idol"

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:05.970
and sometimes I'm like,
sometimes I don't remember.

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:07.200
Like if you think 20 years back

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.940
in your career and you go, huh?

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:10.380
- [Justin] Yeah.
- Like some of it's hard.

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:12.990
- Well, it's wild because
we got shot out of a cannon.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:15.240
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- But I love just being around

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:18.000
and the fact that we were at
the beginning of things, so -

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:18.833
- And we didn't know.
- [Justin] Nobody knew

00:00:18.833 --> 00:00:19.666
what was up.

00:00:19.666 --> 00:00:20.499
Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:00:20.499 --> 00:00:21.630
- The stakes weren't super high for us.

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:22.740
- That was pretty cool actually.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:24.090
- [Justin] Yes, it was.
- Yeah.

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:24.923
Yeah.
- And then we got

00:00:24.923 --> 00:00:26.580
to hang out so much,
and I can tell you this,

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:29.400
if you ever have the chance to see Kelly

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.910
and she ever says, hey, do
you want to play a card game?

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:33.753
Don't.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:36.180
- I've always been competitive.

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:37.620
- She's a killer.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.453
It was speed.
- Are you talking about speed?

00:00:38.453 --> 00:00:39.286
Do you remember, speed?
- Yeah.

00:00:39.286 --> 00:00:40.119
I was gonna say speed, yeah.
- Yes.

00:00:40.119 --> 00:00:41.070
We would hang out and we would play speed

00:00:41.070 --> 00:00:43.020
because there were these
huge swaths of times

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:44.547
and like we would play speed.
- I love speed.

00:00:44.547 --> 00:00:47.670
- And I think I may have won twice

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:49.770
in the hundred times
that we played together.

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:51.300
- I love speed.
- [Justin] Yeah, obviously.

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.130
- I know, but I feel like I
have natural caffeine going in,

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:54.098
you know, I've always been like.

00:00:54.098 --> 00:00:54.931
(Kelly rolling tongue)

00:00:54.931 --> 00:00:55.764
You know?
- [Justin] Yeah.

00:00:55.764 --> 00:00:57.030
- So it was really my game.
- It was ridiculous.

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:58.410
- [Kelly] Okay.
- Yeah, and I was like,

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:00.060
I just kept coming back for more.

